# Out of One's Shell at Prog 1 with no mustZone: Ronan's 86 with a full inventory (the Monk's Headgear does not fit: not
# completed), then with room (completed).
lists PortBastok/Ronan/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/86
char zone=PortBastok pos=84.7,-8.8,21.8
quest Bastok.TheQuadavsCurse completed
quest Bastok.OutOfOnesShell accepted
charvar Quest[1][5]Prog 1
login
fill-inventory
trigger Ronan                        # 86
finish                               # the inventory full: not completed
free-inventory
trigger Ronan                        # 86 again
finish                               # completed
